<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="PRO" style="id">Paunah</book>
  <para style="h">Paunah</para>
  <para style="toc1">Paunah</para>
  <para style="toc2">Paunah</para>
  <para style="mt">Paunah</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Israel kumpi, David’ tapa Solomon Paunahte:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Azieh pen mite in pilna le kithuhilna-te a sin thei nading, a khietna thuh a nei kammalte a theitel nading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />pilvang tahin gamta a, thuman le thutang tawh a kilawm a kituoha a gamtat thei nading;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />mimawte tungah pilvanna thute hilin, khangnote tungah theina le thu khinkhai theina hil nading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />mipilte in zong tami thu za-in a theina uh belap hinlen, thu ngaisut siemna a nga thei nading,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Paunahte, le gentenate, mipilte’ thugente le a telha kamthuhte a theitel nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Topa zatahna in theina kipatna ahi hi; mimawte in pilna le kithuhilna a thusim sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka ta aw, na pa ang thuhilna za inlen, na nu ang thumopte niel sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />azieh pen tuate khu na lutunga paakuol kilawm le na ngawnga na awh khiba tawh kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ta aw, mawneite in ang zawl uleh, nuom malmal sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amate in, “Ko ei zui inlen, sisan luon nading va sui ta vai; huoiham tahin maw nei lo om muong khat va buh ta vai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Hankhuh-a peisuhte bang le Misikhuo bangin cidamin a hinglai pi ma-un amate va valtum ta vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na manpha namkim i mu ding vua, i vanlahte utawh i inn i dim ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kote ei pawl inlen, i unpi-un i sum i paite kitan ciet vai,” ang ci uleh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />ka ta aw, a lampi vuah amate tawh zawhton sinlen, a lampi panun kihemkhie in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />azieh pen amate in sietna lamah a kal uh a nawsuon mama vua, sisan suo nading thu ah a kinaw mama uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Va in ei et laitahin a siena lenthang i zah pan pen a mawkna ahi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />hinanle tua pen a si ding uh ngah a, bawh khinkhian uh hi lel hi! tuale a hinna uh a bei nadinga zong, amahaw kibuhdap ahi lel uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Huoihamna tawh a nga sawm zosiete’ lam tawpna pen tam bang ahi hi; tua banga a nga mite in a hinna utawh a lo uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Gawldung tengah pilna kiko-in, khuolai tuol-awng tengah aw ngai tahin kiko hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihon kikhopna-ah ama kiko hi; ama in khuopi lutna tunkotte ah thu a gen hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“No mimawte aw, bang tanvei mawlawm lai ding na hi uh ahei? Misimmawte in zong bang tanvei simmaw na lai-in, mimawte in theina bang tanvei huo lai ding na hi uh ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kang phawsietna thupise un; note tungah ka ngaisutnate kang sung ding hi; ka thute kang theisah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen ke’n kang hlat vangun note in nei niel vua, ka khut kang zapzap vangun koima’n nei thudon sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Kang thumopte zosie thusim loin, kang phawna khat beh na zui lo ziehun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />ke’n zong na tuosietna uh kang nuisan zieu lel ding hi; zauhuoina in ang nawh uh ciengin kang simmawbawl lel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Zauhuoina in huipi bangin hing nawh gawpin, na tung vuah pumpei bangin vangsietna hing tung a, na tung vuah lungkhamna le khuisahna ang tun ciengin zong, kang thudon sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tua ciengin amate in keima ei hlan ding vua, ahi vangin keima in ka dawng sih ding hi; amate in kintahin ei sui ding vua, ahi vangin ei mu sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in theina muda-in, Topa zatah ding a teel sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />ka thumopte khat zong zui loin, ka phawna zosie a thusim sih vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />tua ziehin amate in a gamtatna ga a ne ding vua, amau’ gelnate ma in amate a gimsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Azieh pen mimawlte in amau’ mottatna a silaw vua, mimawte in amau’ thudon lona a sietlaw uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />hinanle ka thugen a ngai mite a lung uh muong ding a, a siehuoi tuosietna nei loin nuomtahin om hit hiet ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ta aw, ka thugente pomin ka thupiehte na sunga na khol leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />pilna lamah lunglut tahin bil daw-in, thutelna lamah na lungtang na ngat a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />thuthuh thei nuomin kiko tahpi-in thutelna nei nuomin na kiko a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />dangka sui bangin sui-in, a kisel gou bangin na sui leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />tuaci’n nangma in Topa zatahna na thei ding a, Pasien theina na mu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in pilna ei pie a, ama’ kam panin theina le theitelna ang pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ama in thuman mite adingin pilna laigil kholpieh hi; kawbaang lo-a kalsuon mite adingin ama pen kidalna lum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in thutangte’ lampi cingin, ama tunga muonhuoi mite’ lampi kem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua hileh thumanna le thutanna, a kilawm le lampi hoi poma na thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Azieh pen na lungsim sungah pilna ang lut ding a, theina in na hlagau a lungnuomsah ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />thu khinkhai theina in nang ang cing ding a, theitelna in ang kem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuami in gitlona lampi panin nangma ang hunkhie ding a, thulegen mite kung pan le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />khuomiel lampi a zawt nadingun thuman lampi a nuasie mite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />a sie-a gamtat nuom a sa, gitlo letatna-a a lungkim mite,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a lampi uh kawi-in a gamtat sawi mite panin ang kem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A thangtat numei pan le kamhlum no tawh angkawm numeite pan,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />a sen lawm ngaih nuasie a, Pasien tawh a kiciemna a mangngil nu kung panin kang hunkhie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />azieh pen tua nu lampi in sina dongah ang pui a, ama’ peina lampi in sina hlim lam ang tun hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua nu kunga a pei mite ang kilekia ngai nawn sih vua, amate in hinna lampite zong a ngakia nawn sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tuaci’n mi hoite’ lampi tawn inlen, a thutang mite’ lampi zui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen gam sungah thuman mite a teng ding vua, tua sungah mawpeng mite a teng suoh ding uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />ahi vangin tua gam panin migilote kisumang ding a, tua gam panin misol hatte kiphungkal mang ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ta aw, kang thuhilte mangngil sinlen, kang thupiehte na lungtang sungah kem in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />azieh pen tuate in na khankum le na hinkhuo nite ang sausah ding a, nopsahna kicing ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Citahna le muonhuoina in kinuasiesah vawt sin; na ngawng kimvelah tuate vielin, na lungtang suongpeh tungah giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuaci’n Pasien le mite muna-ah maipha le minphatna na nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na lungsim zosie tawh Topa muong inlen, nang theina beh suong sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Na vai zosie-ah ama phawh in, tua hile ama in na lampite ang zangsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma’ kimuna-ah a pilin kingaisuntawm sin; Pasien zatahin gitlona panin kihemkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tua khu na ci na sa adingin damna zatui hi ding a, na pumpi adingin thasuona hi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na neisa le na nasep ga masate tawh Topa zatah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua hile na ansalte an tampi tawh ang kidim ding a na beelte zong lenggazu ang dimlet ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ta aw, Topa ang khalna simmaw sinlen, ama’ ang phawna cimtah sin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />azieh pen a pa in a patat a tapa a thuhil bangin, Topa in a it mite thu a hil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pilna mu a, theitelna a nga mite mi nuomsa ahi hi,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />azieh pen dangka sangin pilna tawh sum bawlna hoizaw a, a met zong kham sangin hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Suong manpha sangin pilna manphazaw a, na deina khat popo tawh tekah thei ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A ziet lamah khansauna a om hi; a vei lamah hauna le patawina a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lampite nopsahna lampi hi a, a lampi zosie kilemna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama a man khate adingin hinna singkung ahi hi; ama a pomdet mite mi nuomsa kici hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa in pilna tawh leitung na phut hi; ama in theitelna tawh vantungte na bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a theina tawh a thuhna sunga om tuite na luongkhiesah a, meiite in daitui a na kiesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ta aw, nangma kung panin tam teng pitmangsah sin; pilna gil le thu khinkhai theina kemcing bo in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tuate pen na hlagau adingin hinna ang hi ding a, na ngawng adingin kizepna ang suoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tua ciengin lungmuongin lam na zawt ding a, na keng na suikha sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na to leh zong na zau sih ding hi; na lup ciengin zong na kimut a nuom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Migilote tunga a tung huipi le pataunate ang ditun ciengin zong zau malmal sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />azieh pen Topa khu na lungmuonna ang hi ding a, ang kimat nading panin na keng ang kemcing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Na bawl zawh ding ahi nah leh panpi dinga a kilawmte tungah sil hoi sep ding kidiem sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na nei nahpi na vengpa kungah, “Va pei phot inlen, hing peikia in, zing cieng nang pie vang,” ci sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Nang ang muonga nangma’ pang ang bel na vengpa tungah a gim nga nading bangma vaihawm sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Na tungah sietna bangma ang kibawl sih leh a thu om lo pi-in koima tawh kihau sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mi tatsiete eng sinlen, a gamtatnate uh teel sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />azieh pen a letat mite Topa in kidah a, ahi vangin ama in midihte a muong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Migilote’ inn sungah Topa’ samsietna tung a, hizongle ama in midihte’ tenna thupha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Mi simmawte ama in simmaw a, a neilut mite maipha a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Mipilte in patawina a luo ding vua, hizongle a lungkhau mi mawte in mindaina a nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tate aw, na pa uh’ ang thuhilna ngai unlen, thuthuh theina na nga nadingun limtahin ciemte un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />azieh pen keima in zui ding thuhoite nang kang pie hi. Kang thuhilte mangngil sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka pa tawh ka khangmoi lai, ka nu’ angvan tapa khat ka hi lai-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />ama in thu ei hil a, ka kungah, “Na lungsim in ka thugente tukipsah in; kang thupiehte zui-in hing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pilna sin in; thuthuh zong sin in: Mangngil sinlen, ka kam pana a pusuoh thute panin pielmang sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pilna taisan sin, tua hile ama in nang ang kem ding hi; pilna it in, tua hile ama in nang ang cing ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pilna kipatna tam ahi hi: Pilna sui in, adang na nga thei poma sui in, thutel theina kisui in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilna thupisah mama in, tua hile ama in ang lamsang ding hi; ama pom lacin ama in nang ang patawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ama in na lutungah a etlawm paakuol ang khusah ding hi; ama in na tungah a kilawm kumpi lukhu ang khusa ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka ta aw, na khan kumte a sau nadingin ka thugente ngai inlen sang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Pilna lampi kang hil zo hi; thumanna lampi-ah kang pui zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lam na pei ciengin na kalsuonna ang nawngkaisah sih ding hi; Na tai leh zong na kipai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ang kithuhilnate tukip in; tuate hlasuo vawt sin; na hin nading ahi ziehin tua khu kepsiem in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Migilote’ lampi ah pei sinlen, sietna bawlte lampi ah zong pei sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Tua khu pel in; tuanah pei sin. Tua pan kihei-in kansan in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Azieh pen sietna a bawl sih uleh amate a kimuthei sih uhi; mi khat’ pua nading a bawl masangsie a kimu ngim thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Azieh pen amate in gitlona an ne-in, kheltatna zu a dawn uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanle thuman mite’ lampi ahile sunkim donga a tang semsem, zingmawng khuovah pan tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Migilote’ lampi pen khuomiel thuhpi tawh kibang a, a palkhahna sontah uzong amate in a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ta aw, ka thugente lunglut tahin ngai in; ka thugente na bil ei ngat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nangma’ mun panin amate pitsah sin; na lungsim sungah kemcing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Azieh pen a mute dingin tuate in hinna ahi a, a pumpi zosie vua dingin damna zatui ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pilvangin na lungtang kem in, azieh pen tua panin hinna tuisam a pul hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thukawi genna pai dawh inlen, thulegenna gamla pelh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na masang lam en inlen, na mailam tangtahin mitsuon in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Na zawt lampi tangsah in, tua hile na khuoheina ang kicien ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ziet le vei-ah piel vawt sin; sietna panin na keng hei in.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ta aw, ka pilna thu ah lunglut in; ka theitelna na bil ei ngat in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu khinkhai theina tukip in, tua hile na kam in theina a kem thei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Azieh pen a thangtat numei’ nephu pen khuoizu-a kidiesa bang a, a kamham sathau sangin zolzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hinanle a tawpna-ah ama gamsai bangin kha a, a langni-a a kitathiem namsau tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A keng sina lamah peisuh a, Misikhuo lampi zui-in kalsuon hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hinna lampi-ah a ma a tang pei sih hi; a lampi-ah vahvai-in, a vahvai lam zong a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka ta aw, tu-in ka thugen ngai inlen, ka kam pana a pusuoh thute panin piel sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama gamlapi panin pel inlen, ama’ inn kotbieng va nai sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />tua hi sihle na minphatna uh midangte tungah na pie kha ding vua, noma’ hin kumte hepina a nei lo mite tungah na pie kha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amau’ tai nading bepin khuolmite in na neisa teng uh a zang ding vua, nasep gimna teng uh midangte’ inn ah a tung ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />na hinna a tawp kuon lam, na tel na vo ang tawp ciengin, guitamin na tau ding a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />tuale nangma in, “Aw, bangci-in kithuhilna muda-in, ka lungsim in zong phawsietna a thusim lo mawh a ta diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ei hil siete’ thugen ka mang nuom sih a, ei hilnate uh ka na thudon kha sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tu-in mipi kikhopna lahah a siecip tahtah hi ta’ng e,” na ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na tuibem pana tuite le na tuikhuh pana tuite dawn in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na tuinah letmangin lamdung tengah luitui-in luongsah mawh ding na mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tuate nang ding beh hisah inlen, midang tawh kitang sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nangma’ tuikhuh in thupha nga-in, na senzi tawh nuomsa inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />tua pen a it huoi sazuhpi le a deihuoi sazuhtang bang heh. A nawite tawh tai den inlen, a itna in na lai kuoi den taheh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ta aw, bang dinga numei dang khat na lunggul a, angkawm numei khat’ kanglum na va kawi tah ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen Topa in mihingte’ gamtatna teng mu a, a lampite uh zosie a sittel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Migilote’ a gamtatna sietna in amate thangsie a, a mawna thangkhaute vuah amate a awh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khalna a op lo ziehin a si vua, a mot seng ziehun a mangthai uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ta aw, na vengpa’ leiba lopieh ding kamciemna pie-in, midang khat adingin kiciemna na nei khah leh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />na nephu pana na thugente tawh thang kisie na hi a, na kamham in nangma ang mat ahi ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka ta aw, tua bang na hi khah leh nang le nang kihunkhie in, azieh pen na vengpa’ thuneina sunga lut kha na hi tah ziehin, mallangtahin pei inlen na vengpa kungah va thum ta’n.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Na mit pelsah inlen, na kimut suohsah sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />sabeng pa kung pana a suohta sakhi bang le thangsie pa khut sung pana a suohta va bangin nang le nang kihunkhie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi thadapa aw, mesi kungah pei in; amau’ gamtat zie ngaisun inlen, tua khu pilna-in nei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate in a uh ding le a makai ding vaihawm nei lo napi uh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />khuokhal hun sungin an a khol vua, anlah hun sungin an a kaikhawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi thadapa aw, bang tanvei lumlum lai-in, bangcih ciengin na kimutna pan thokia ding na hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bano khat sung na kimut kal, bano khat sung na haituh kal, bano khat sung khut zepin na khawl kalin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />mi suompa bangin na kungah zawnna ang tung ding a, galhangpa bangin na kungah kitasapna ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thu ningkawi genin miginalo pa le mimaw pa a kawiva vua,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />mit-hem tawh mi en kawi-in, a keng utawh a sui vua, a khutme utawh mi a kawh kawikawi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A lungsim uh zulzau-in sietna behbeh a gel vua, kimatmaw nading behbeh a bawl ngitnget uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tua bang mite tungah tuosietna thakhatin tung ding hi; mitphet kalin bawlphat thei nawn lo kisietna a tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Topa in a huot mama na guh om a, ama in kidahhuoi a sah mama na sagi a om hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kiphatsahna mit, zuouthu genna leii, mawnei lote’ sisan a luongsah khut,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />thusie a bawl sawm lungtang, sietna bawl ding a kinaw keng,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a man lo-a zuouthu teci pangte le innkuon sunga kilem lona khaici vawte ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka ta aw, na pa ang thupiehte zui inlen, na nu ang thumopte taisan vawt sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na lungtangah tuate khi zing in; na ngawngah tuate aw zing in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na kalsuonna-ah tuate in nangma lam ang pui ding hi; na lup ciengin zong tuate in nangma ang vil ding hi; na khahlaw ciengin tuate in nangma ang hopi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Azieh pen thupiehna in meivah ahi a, thuhilna in khuovah ahi hi. Kiphawsietna le kikhalna in hinna lampi ahi a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />mi dangte’ zi pan le numei pahtatte’ kamzol panin nangma ang kem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na lungtangah tua nu’ mel hoina ipla kha sinlen, ama’ ang zawlmit hana hlengla kha vawt sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />azieh pen numei pahtat khat’ guoiman anlum khat beh ahi a, ahi vangin numei zummaw in pasal khat’ hinna buppi siesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A puon ka loin mi khat in a kangah meikuong a puo thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ahi sihle a keng ka loin mei-am lahah mi khat a pei thei amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A vengpa’ zi tawh a lumton mipa in tua bang a thuoh ding hi; tua nu a tham kha popo dan thuoh loin om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gutate in a gilkiel ciengun a gilkiel phat nading beha mi van a guh uh ciengin, amate kisimmaw lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hizongle amate a kimat khah leh, a za sagi-in lo ding uhi; amate in a inn sung vua om neisa zosie tan ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Hinanle angkawm pa pen ngaisutna nei lo mi ahi a, tua banga a gamta mipa ama le ama kisusie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Ama in liemna le minsietna thuoh ding a, ama’ mindaina kiphietmang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Azieh pen thangsietna in pasal thangpaisah a, ama in phu a lah ciengin koima a diem vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Ama in khiel man sang lo ding a, bangza-in guhgol a tam zongin sang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka ta aw, ka thugente zui inlen, kang thupiehte na sungah khol in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka thupiehte zui-in hinpi inlen, na mit nauta na kepcing bangin ka thuhilnate kemcing in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />na khutme-ah tuate viel inlen, na lungtang suongpeh tungah zong giel in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pilna kungah, “Ka nau nu na hi hi,” ci inlen, thuthuh theina kungah ka lawm it pen na hi hi, ci-in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hile tua thute in numei thangtatte le kamzol a zang numei pahtatte’ kamsiemna panin ang kem ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Azieh pen ka opna inn tawlet-a vathangah ka khuodah a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />mimawlte lah le tangvalnote lahah thukhen tel thei lo tangval khat ka mu hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ama in tua nu innkiu lampi nawtsuoh a, ama’ opna inn lam manaw-in a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tua hun pen nitah nitum zaw zan hun le khuomiel kuon ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuaci’n numei pahtat banga kizem a lungpheng numei khat ama lam zuonin a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ama kamtamin lungkhau hi; a innah a om ngim thei sih hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />khatvei le lamdungah, khatvei le tuol-awng teng le, mi inn ningkawi tengah mi buhdapin a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tua nu in ama manin tawp a, tuale maitai tahin tua pa kungah:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuni-in biehpiehna ka bawl a, kiciemna zong ka bawl hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />tuaci’n tu-in nang dawn dinga ang kuon ka hi hi, nangma sui citahin kang sui a, tu-in kang mu ta hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Egypt puongiel hoite tawh ka lupna, a tuomnate ka zem zo hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />myrrh panamtui, aloes panamtui le cinnamon panamtuite tawh ka lupna ka namtuisah zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hing pei in, zingmawng dongin lungcim tahin ki-itna bawl vai; itna tawh eima gel nuomsa vai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Azieh pen inn ah ka pasal om lo hi; khuol gamlapi zinin a kuon zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ama in sum-ip khat keng a, hlalia masangin inn ang tung sih ding hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A kamsiem tawh tua nu in ama zawl vangut hi; a kamhlum tawh a gen ziehin a nua a zuipausah ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A kigaw nading mun lam a zuon bawngtang bang le, a awh nading thang zuona a kitom sazuh bangin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />thaltang in a gilsung a pailet dongin ama in thakhatin tua nu a zui pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tu-in, ka ta aw, ka thugen ngai inlen, ka kam pana pusuoh ka thugente limtahin ngai in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua nu’ lampite-ah na lungsim hei kha sin; tua nu’ lampi-ah piel poma sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Azieh pen ama nu in mi tampi puasah a, ama nu ziehin mi tampite in a silaw uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tua nu’ inn pen Misikhuo zotna lampi hi a, sina innkhan peisuhna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pilna in hing hlanin theitelna hing kiko hi lo amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Munsangte tung, lampi gei, lamkabawm teng ah a ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />khuopi mai-a tunkot gei, inn lutna kot gei-ah a kiko hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Mite aw, no ang hlan ka hi a, ka kikona, mihingte zosie a hlan ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />No mimawlawmte aw, thu khinkhai theina sin un; tuami kisamte in lungsim pilna sin un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ngai un, azieh pen thu manphate kang gen ding a, ka kam sung panin thuman vive ang pusuoh ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />azieh pen ka kam in thuman thutah a gen ding hi; gitlona pen ka nephute adingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka kam pana ka gen zosie thuman vive ahi hi; tuate sungah thu kuolgen le thukawilieng bangma om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thu theitel mite adingin ka thugente tang a, theina a neisate adingin thuman ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ngun tangin kang thuhilna kilahzaw unlen, kham tangin thu theina kiteelzaw un;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />azieh pen suong manpha sangin pilna hoizaw a, na dei na zosiete tawh zong tekah thei ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pilna ahi keima pen thu khinkhai theina tawh ka tengton a, theina le a kilawm ngaisut theina ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Topa zatahna in gitlona mudana ahi hi. Kiphatsahna, kihisahna, gitlo gamtatna le thu legennate ka huo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngaisut hoi le pilna gil ka nei hi; thuthuh theina, le hatna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Keima ziehin kumpite maang a, gam-uhte in thutangin thu a khen uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />gam-uhte le milien zosiete in kei ziehin a manin a uh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kei ei itte ka it a, kintaha ei suite in ei mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keima in haunate le patawina, hauna kip le nopsahna ka nei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Keima’ ga pen kham sangin, kham citah nangawn sangin hoizaw hi. Keima’ gasuo zong pen ngun hoipen sangin hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Keima in dihna lampi ka zui a, thutang lampi dung tawnin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />ei it mite hauna ka pie a, a gougil koina uh ka dim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in ama’ na a sep cilin keima ei na siem a, tangtawnga ama’ septe sung panin keima a masa pen ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tanglai peh panin ei kisiem zo a, lei pien masanga ei kibawl masa pen ka hi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tui thuhpite le tui tampi luonna tuinahte a om nai lo lai-in ka pieng zo ta bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Muolsangte a kisiem masang, muoltangte mai-ah, ei piengsah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Leitung le gamlah a bawl masang, leitung’ amasa pen lei themte a bawl masangin zong kei ka pieng zo ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in vante a munah a koi lai, tuipi maitanga a kuol a bawl lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />tung lama vante bawlin a kipsah lai, tuipi tuinahte a bawl lai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />tuipi in ama’ thupiehte a palsat lo nadingin leitung kiphuna zungpite a ciemte lai-in kei ka pieng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuaci’n nasem uhte bangin, ama’ gei-ah ka om hi; nisim sielin ama’ lungkimna keima ka hi a, ama’ mai-ah lungdamin nuomsa zingin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ama’ tenna leisiet tungah kei ka kipah a, mihingte lahah nuom ka sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />“Ka tate aw, tu-in ka thugen ei ngai un; ka gamtat dan a zuite mi nuomsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Kithuhilna za-in pil unlen, thudon loin mawh op sih un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Ka thugen ngai-in, ka tunkotah nisimin ei cing ei vilin, ka kotpite gei-a ei ngah lenlon mipa khu mi nuomsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Azieh pen kei ei mu poma in hinna a mu vua, Topa tung panin zong maipha a nga uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />hizongle keima ei mu lo mite, amau le amau a kiliemsuo ahi hi; keima ei muda mi zosie a si nuom ahi hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pilna in a inn lam zo ta a, khuompi sagi sui zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A gante go zo-in a zu a pawi a, an neh nading sabuoi zong a pha hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ama in khuo sung munsang pente panin mi hlan dingin a nasem numeite sawl a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“No, thu thei lote aw, tanah hing pei un!” ci-in hlanin, thu khentel thei lote kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Hing pei unlen, ka an ne-in ka zupawisa hing dawn ta un.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Picinlona taisanin nungta unlen, thuthuh theina lampi tawn un,” cisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi simmaw khat thu a hil poma in maizumna nga hi; migilote a phawh poma in liemna nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A kiphawhsie mi simmaw pa in ang muda bep lel ding hi; mipilte na phawsiet ciengin ang it ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipilte thuhil in, tua hile amate ang pil semsem ding uhi; midihte thuhil in, tua hile a theina uh ang kibelap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa zatahna in pilna kipatna ahi a, Siengtho Pa theina in thuthuh theina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile keima ziehin na hinkhuo nite ang khang ding a, na khankumte ang kibelap ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Nang na pil leh nangma dinga a pil na hi hi; pilna na thuse sih leh nang beh in na thuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Numei mawte a nah ham hi; ama mawlawmin bangma a thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama’ inn kot zungah to a, khuopi bosang munte tunga a topha tungah to-in,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />amau’ lampi cieta a pei, tua mun a nawh kha mite hlan a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“No, thu thei lote aw, tanah hing pei un!” ci-in hlanin, thu khentel thei lote kungah,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A kigudap tui hlum deu a, a kidapneh an tui deu hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hinanle amate in tua munah misite a op lam le a thuhna Misikhuo-ah tua nu’ lenglate a op lam a thei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Solomon’ paunahte. Tapa pil in a pa lungdamsah a, tapa maw in a nu dasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gitlona tawh a kinga goute in phattuomna a nei sih a, sina panin dihna in ei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in thuman mite a gilkielin a koi sih a, ama in migilote a du uh a ngawlsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A thasie khut in mi zawngsah a, a thanuom khut in mi hausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Khal lai-a an khol pa pen tapa pilvang ahi a, anlah huna a kimu tapa in maizumna piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Midihte’ lutungah thupha om a, migilote’ kam in kheltatna selcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Midihte kiphawna pen thupha ahi a, migilote’ min muotmang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mipilte’ lungtang in thupiehte thudon ding a, a mot ham mimaw pa in sietna a tut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Citahna lampi a zui poma lungnuomin kalsuon ding a, gitlona lampi a zui poma kiphawhkhie veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A mit-hem tawh mi a en poma in buoina piengsah a, hangsantaha mi a phawsieh pa in kilemna piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Midihte’ kamham in hinna tuinah ahi a, migilote’ kamham in tatsietna a selcip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mudana in kihauna piengsah a, itna in khielna teng khucip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thutelna nei pa’ kam sungah pilna kimu a, pilna a nei lote’ elzang ah ciengpum a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipilte in theina a khol vua, mimawte’ mot hamna in sietna tungsah bai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mihaute’ hauna in amau’ kulpi ahi hi; mizawngte’ zawnna in amau’ kisietna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thumante’ thaman in hinna lamah pui a, migilote’ nga phattuomna in mawna lamah a pui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kithuhilna a thudon poma hinna lampi tunga om ahi a, phawsietna a nuol poma a lam pielmang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zuou kam in mudana selcip a, mi gensie poma mimaw ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thu a kitam gen ciengin khielna zong a om pai a, mi pilvangte ham a ki-ip uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Midihte leii in nguntang hoipen ahi a, migilote’ lungsim bangma a man sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Midihte’ nephu in mi tampi vah a, mimawte in a motna a sipi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa’ thupha in hauna piengsah a, ama in tua tawh dana kici a belap sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khielna bawl ding pen mimawte adingin apmaina bang lel a, theitelna a nei mi in pil gamtat nuom a sa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Migilote tungah amau’ giinpen tung ding a, thuman mite ahi uleh a dei bang uh kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Huipi in a nawh ciengin migilote a om nawn sih vua, midihte ahi uleh kumtawnin kip ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Lengga tuithua in ha zasah a, meikhu in mit a sipsah bangin, mi thadate in nasep a ciel a pute gentheisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa zatahna in khan sausah a, migilote’ khankum a tom ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Midihte’ kinepna khu lungdamna-ah a tawp a, migilote’ kinepna bangma lo a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi thumante adingin Topa’ lampi in munkip muonhuoi ahi a, sietna a bawl mite adingin kisuhsietna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Midihte a opna panun kisuonkhie lo ding a, migilote ahi uleh gam sungah a omsuoh sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Midihte’ kam panin pilna pusuoh a, thusie a gen leii ki-atsan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Midihte’ nephu kam in mite’ san thei ding thu thei a, migilote kam ahile thusie vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Topa in a man lo tawikhaina muda a, tawisuong man in ama’ lungkimna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kiphatsahna a op ciengin minsietna tung pai hi; pilna pen a kiniemkhieh mite tawh a omton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Midihte a citahna in makai a, mi zuou theite ahile a lungsim kawina un amate a susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thangpai ni ciengin haunate in phattuomna ei pie sih a, dihtatna in sina panin ei hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Genbang lo mite’ dihtatna in a lampi uh tangtahin zui a, migilote ahile amau’ gitlona tawh a pua uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi thumante’ dihtatna in amate hundam a, mi zuou theite pen amau’ gelna sungah a awh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Migilote a si ciengin amau’ kinepna mangthai a, Pasien nei lote’ kinepna zong bangma lo a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lungkhamna panin midihte kihunkhie a, khum munah migilote a lut zawsop uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Pasien nei lote in a kam utawh a vengte susie a, midihte ahi uleh theina tawh a suohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Midihte a dau uh a pei ciengin khuopite lungdam uhi; migilote a manthai ciengin lungdam kikona om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mithumante’ thupha ziehin khuopi khat kitawisang a, migilote’ thugen ziehin tua khuopi kithalpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midang khat a neubawl poma pilna nei lo ahi a, mipil pa ham loin sip dide hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi gensie pa in a thusim teng genin vah kawikawi a, mi muonhuoi pa in thu im khinkhian hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kimakaina a op lona munah minam pua a, thukuppi ding a kicinna munah lungmuonna a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Theilo mi khat’ leiba lopieh dinga na kikhamna in gimna ang tun ding a, tua banga bawl ding nielna-ah lungmuonna omzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi hepi thei numei in patawina nga a, hoina a muda nu ahile maizumna tawh a kituom hi. Mi meipuote in bangma nei lo a, a hakat mi in hauna nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A migite ahile amau le amau thaman kipie ahi vua, a gilo mite pen amate a kiliemsuo ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Migilote in hamphatna tahtah nga lo a, dihna khaici a tute in thaman mantah a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Dihna sunga a kukal poma a nungta ding vua, sietna a sulzui mi poma a si ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lungsim kawite pen Topa adingin kidahhuoi a, genbanglo mite lampi in ama’ lungkimna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Migilote dan tuoh loin om lo ding hi, ci thu telcien in, ahi vangin midihte a suohta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Thu hoi a ngaisun thei lo a melhoi numei pen vohpi nephu dawna kham kuol kibasah tawh kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Midihte’ lunggul pen a hoi lam behbeh ah a tawp hi; migilote’ kinepna pen lungthahna behbeh a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi pawlkhat in pie ziehzieh napi a hau semsem uhi; adangte in a pieh ding uh hendap napi, cimaw gentheina beh a thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A phal mipa hau semsem ding a, tui a pie pa in tui ma a ngakia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Antang zua nuom lote mipite in a gausam vua, a zua mite tungah thupha kipie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Hanciem taha thuhoi a suite in maipha a nga vua, sietna a sui mite tungah sietna ma a tung hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A hauna uh a muong mite a vulmang ding vua, midihte, singna dawng bangin a khanpha ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A innkuon sung a buoisah mite a hawmsuoh ding vua, mimawte pen mipilte’ sila a suoh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Midihte’ ga in hinna singkung ahi a, mi kheltatte in mi tampi a that uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Leitungah midihte a kithuhkia pai hi leh, migilote le mawneite bangza-in a kithuhkia zaw kan lai diei!
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kithuhilna a deite in theina a dei vua, kiphawsietna a zadate mimaw ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi hoite in Topa tung pan maipha nga a, ama in sietna a bawl sawm mite a mawsiet hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gitlona tawh koima in lungmuonna a mu sih a, midihte’ zungpi kilawh ngai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Zi hoi pen a pasal’ mang lukhu hi a, mi a zumsuo numei pen a pasal’ gunatna tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midihte’ ngaisutna pen thutang ahi hi; migilote’ gelna pen mi solna vive ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Migilote’ thugen pen mi that dinga buhdapna hi a, thumante’ thugen in amate hunkhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Migilote kithalpai-in a om ta sih vua, midihte’ inn a kip zawsop hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi khat a ngaisut hoina hang tawh ama kigenpha a, lungsim letat mite kisimmaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Neh ding nei lopi-a mi thupi banga op sangin simmaw thuohin nasem khat nei ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Midihte in a ganhingte’ kisapna thei a, migilote’ khuotuona in tatsietna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amau’ lo a hlote in an hau ding a, kimanna nei lo nate a del kawikawite thu ngaisun thei lote ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Migilote in gitlona pana a nga uh nate deigaw a, midihte’ zungpi in ga a ga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Migilote a hamna panun a khielnate utawh a awh vua, midihte ahi uleh buoina panin suohta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kamsiemna panin mi khat na hoite tawh kidim a, thatang tawh nasepna in a thaman a nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mimawte in a gamtatna uh a manin ngaisun a, mipilte in ahile mite’ thukuppina a ngai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mimawte in a lungthahna uh thakhatin a kilangsah vua, mi pilvangte in zakona a awlmaw sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thuman thutah a gen poma in thuman teci pang ahi a, a man lo teci in zuouthu beh a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ngaisutna nei lo-a hamna in namsau bangin mi sun a, mipilte’ kamham in damna a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Thuman a gen nephu kipden a, zuouthu gen leii ahile bakhat beh kimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sietna a gelte’ lungsim sungah solna beh om a, kilemna ding vaihawmte a lungdam uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Midihte tungah sietna tung lo a, migilote buoina tawh kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Topa in zuouthu a gen nephu kidah a, muonhuoi taha a gamtate ama’ lungkimna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mipil pa in a theina im khinkhian a, mimaw pa’ lungsim in a motna pholahlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Na sem dingin mi thadate a kipausawl laitahin, mi thanuomte’ khut in a uh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lunghimawna in mi lungkiesah a, a hoi kamham in mi lungdamsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Midihte in a guolte ngaisutna hoi pie a, migilote’ gamtatna in lam a pielsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mi thadate in a samatte uh a hang sih vua, mi thanuomte in a manpha haunate a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Midihte’ lampi-ah hinna om a, tua lampi zuina-ah sina a om sih hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tapa pil in thuhilna dei a, mi simmawte in phawsietna a ngai nuom sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi hoite in a thugenna ga panun na hoite a ne ding vua, mi zuoute’ deina pen sietna bawl ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A kam a kem zo mite pen a hinna uh kembih ahi pai uhi; a kam a golkahte ahile a kisie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi thanuomte’ deina a kiphungvua laitahin, mi thadate in deigaw napi bangma a nga sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Midihte in zuouthu muda a, migilote zumhuoi tah le mindaihuoi tahin a gamta uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Dihtatna in thutanga a gamta mipa cing a, mawna in migilote a thalpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mi kimkhat bangma nei lopi kihausah a, adang kimkhatte hau napi kizawngsah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hauna pen mi khat’ hinna takhietna ahi a, mizawng pa in galgihna kam a za sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Midihte’ khuovah lungdam a, migilote’ meivah a mit hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hil ding a nuom lo kihisahna in kihauna piengsah a, mi thukuppite tawh pilna a omton hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kinaw nga hauna kiemsuh pai ding a, a themthem-a khol mite’ sum khangkhang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A tungpah lo lametna in lungtang nasah a, lungtup tunna in hinna singkung ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuhilna simmawte in amate tunga sietna tut ahi vua, thupieh a zatah mite ahile thaman kipie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mipilte’ thuhilna in hinna tuinah ahi a, tua pen sina thang tawh mi khat a kipelna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thu ngaisut siemna in maipha ngana ahi a, upna nei lote’ lampi in amau’ kisietna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi pilvangte in na zosie pilna tawh a sem vua, mimawte in a motna uh a pholahlah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kamtai hoi lo in mi buoisah a, palai muonhuoi in mi damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Zawnna le mindaina pen thuhilna a thusim lote ading ahi a, phawsietna a thudon pa a kipatawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Deina tangtunna in hlagau adingin hlum vangut a, sietna bawl nading pana kiheina in mimawte dingin muthada huoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipilte tawh kigop mite mipil a suoh pai vua, mimawte tawh kigopte in gimna a thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hamsietna in mawneite sulzui a, cithei nopsahna in midihte thaman a pie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi hoite in a tu a tate’ luo ding gouluo nuasiepieh a, mawneite’ neisate pen midihte dinga kikhol hi lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mizawngte’ lo-ah an tampi pieng thei a, thutang a op lo ziehin tuate maimang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ciengpum zang nuom lote a tate muda ahi a, amate a it mite in limtahin amate a thuhil hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Midihte in a khamkhop uh a nei vua, migilote’ gilpi ahile a hawmsuoh hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Numei pil in a inn lam a, numei maw in a khut tawh phel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thuman-a kalsuonte in Topa a zatah vua, thuman lo-a gamta mi in ama a simmaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mimawte’ ham in a elduong vua dingin ciengpum ahi a, mipilte’ nephu in amate kemcing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawngtang op lona ah an a om sih hi; bawngtang’ hatna tawh an tampi kila hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Teci muonhuoi in zuouthu gen lo a, a man lo teci in zuouthu a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi simmaw pa in a mawhna-in pilna sui a, thu theitel mite adingin pilna ol mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mimawte’ opna pelh in, azieh pen nang in tuanah thu theina na mu sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi teite’ pilna in a pei nading uh lampi theitelna ahi a, mimawte’ motna in lam khielsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mimawte in khielna ziehin biehna a simmaw vua, mi thumante in Pasien’ maipha nga-in nuom a sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungtang in ama’ gentheina thei a, midangte in a lungnoppi thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Migilote’ inn kisusie a, thuman mite’ puonbuh gina semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi khat dinga a man tawh a kibang lampi pen a tawpna ah sina lampi hi theizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nui pum nangawnin lungtang na a, nopna a ven ciengin lunggimna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A letat mite in a gamtatna utawh kituohin a nga vua, mi hoite in a sepna utawh kituohin a nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mimawte in thu zosie um pai a, mi teite in a kalsuon nading ngaisun hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mipilte kidawmin sietna panin a kihem vua, mimawte ahile kihisahin a kidawm sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A lungtom mite mottat a, thugel mite kimuda hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mimawte motna tawh kizem a, mi teite theina lukhu kikhusah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mihoite mai-ah misiete kun a, thumante’ tunkotah migilote a kun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A vengte nangawn in mizawngte ngai lo a, mihaute in lawm le guol tampi a nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A vengte’ simmaw mite mawnei hi a, mizawng a hepite mi nuomsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gitlo a sawmte a khiel hi lo uh amah? Thuhoi gelte in mite’ zatahna le muonna nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Gimpipi-a nasepna zosie-ah phattuomna om a, kamkumna lel pen in zawnna-ah ei tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mipilte’ mang lukhu in a pilna uh ahi a, mimawte’ paakuol in a motna uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Thutah a gen teci in mihingte’ hinna hundam a, zuouthu gen pa mi leheh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Topa zatahna sungah mi khat in muonna kip nei a, a tate in kibuhna a nei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Topa zatahna in hinna tuinah ahi a, tua khu mi khat in sina thang a pel thei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Gammi tamna in kumpipa’ minthanna hi a, gam mite op lona-ah gam-uhte kisie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A lungduoi mi poma theitelna lienpi nei hi a, a lungthah bai mipa in motna a tawisang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Lungnopna in tahsa adingin hinna hi a, thangpaina in guletang muotsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Mizawngte a bawlsiete pen a Bawlpa simmaw ahi a, tasamte a hepi mite in ama a zatah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Amau’ gamtat sietna in migilote thalpai a, midihte in a citahna sung vuah kibuhna a mu uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Theitelna a nei mite’ lungsim sungah pilna teng a, mimawte’ lungtangah tua pilna kithei kha lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Dihtatna in minam tawisang a, mawna in mi khatpo adingin mindaina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Pilvang taha a gamta nasempa in kumpipa’ maipha nga a, zumhuoi taha gamta pa tungah ama’ thangpaina tung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kamnem a dawnna in thangpaina damsah a, kamkhauh in lungthahna a sosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mipilte’ kam in theina gen a, mimawte’ kam in motna phulsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa’ mit in mun zosie mu a, misie le mipha encien zing hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kamnem in hinna singkung ahi a, kam gilo in lungsim suzan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mimawte in nu le pate’ thuhilna simmaw bawl a, thuhilna a thupisim mipa pen mi pilvang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi thumante’ inn sungah gougil tampi om a, migilote’ hauna in buoina piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mipilte’ kam in theina thezah hi; mimawte’ lungsim sungah tua bang om lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Migilote’ biehpiehna in Topa adingin kidahhuoi a, midihte’ thungetna in ama’ lungkimna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Topa in migilote’ gamtatna kidahhuoi sa a, ama in dihna lam a del mipa a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lamkhiel mite adingin thuhilna khauh om a, phawsietna a mudate a si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Topa mai-ah Misikhuo le Sietna kipholahin a om hi, tua ahile mihingte’ lungsim bangza-in a kipholah zaw kan lai diei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mi simmawte in a kiphawsiet ding a dei sih vua, mipilte kungah amate a pei sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lungsim nopna in maitaisah a, lungsim gimna in lungsim suzan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Theitelna a nei mipa’ lungsim in pilna sui a, mimawte in motna tawh a kam uh a va uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A hin sung tungtawnun mizawngte in hahsatna thuohin, a lungdam mite in a tawntungin pawi a bawl uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Gougil tampi nei-a tua tawh lungkham sangin Topa zatahna tawh themkhat beh nei-a i op hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Kimudana tawh bawngthau’ sa nehna sangin ki-itna a opna munah ante me neh hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A lungtom mite in kihauna piengsah a, a lungduoi mite in kihauna daisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi thadate’ lampi lingkungte tawh kidim a, midihte’ lampi pen a phei lam lienpi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tapil in a pa lungdamsah a, tamawte in a nute simmaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ngaisutna a nei lo mite in motna kipahpi a, thu theitel mipa pen tangtahin gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Kikupna om lo gelnate kikhiel a, thukuppi tampite tawh a maa a tun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A kilawma dawn theina in koipo lungdamsah a, a kilawm huna thugen bangza tahin hoi ahei!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Azieh pen mipilte’ hinna lampi in a tunglam peipi to a, tua khu a nei lama om Misikhuo a pel thei nading uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Topa in mi kiphasahte’ inn phelkhepieh a, ama in meigongte’ gamgi keppieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Gelna hoi lote Topa adingin kidahhuoi ahi a, hizongle ama muna-ah kamsiemna zong a siengtho ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A manlopi-a nga nopna ziehin huoihamna in amau’ inn sung buoina piengsah a, hinanle guhgol mudate a hing ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Midihte’ lungsim in bangci dawn ding ci thu lungngai phot a, migilote’ kam in thusie a suokhie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Migilote kung panin Topa gamla op a, ama in midihte’ thungetna a za hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Maitaina in lungsim kipahsah a, thutha hoi in pumpi tha thosah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Kithuhilna laigil a thudonte mipilte lahah a teng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thuhilna awlmaw lote amau le amau a kisimmaw ahi a, kithuhilna a thupisimte in thu theitelna nga uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Topa zatahna pen pilna sungah kithuhilna hi pai a, patawina masangin kiniemkhiehna a pei hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lungsima gelnate pen mihing-a’ hi a, kam tawh dawnna ahile Topa kung pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing in gamtatna zosie ama’ muna-ah man sa a, hinanle Topa in amau’ lungsim na tawite hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa tungah na vaite ap in, tua hile na gelnate tangtung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Topa in na zosie tupna nei cietin bawl a, migilote nangawn zong buoina ni-in sietna thuoh dinga a bawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A kiphasah mite zosie Topa in kidahhuoi sa a, amate dan tuoh loin om lo ding hi, ci thu telcien in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Citahna le muonhuoina tawh mawmaina kinga a, Topa zatahna tawh mi khat in gitlona pel thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mite’ gamtatna in Topa a lungdamsah ciengin, ama in a galte uh nangawn amate tawh kilemsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thutang lo tawh tampitah i nei sangin thumanna tawh tawmno khat i nei hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mihing lungsim in sep ding gel a, hinanle Topa in kalsuonnate lamlah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kumpipa’ nephu in thuneina tawh a khensat hi; ama in thu a khen ciengin a khiel ngai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Tawikhaina man le tawisuongte Topa -a’ hi a, ip sunga om a gihte zosie ama’ bawlsa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Dihna in kumpi topha a kipsah ziehin, a sie-a gamtat ding pen kumpite adingin kidah a huoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A thudih nephute pen kumpipa’ lungkimna ahi a, ama in thuman gente a it hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa’ thangpaina pen sina kamtaipa hi a, mipil khat poma in ama lungdamsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kumpipa’ maitaina ah hinna om a, ama’ maipha pen guo zusah meiite tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kham sangin pilna nga ding bangza-in hoizaw ahei! Ngun sangin thu theitelna teelhuoi zaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Midihte’ lampi in sietna pel hi; amau’ lampi a kemcingte in amau’ hinna zong a kem hi pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Sietna a tun masangin kihisahna om a, puana a tun masangin kiphatsahna lungsim a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi kisatheite tawh vanlah i hawm sangin lungsim kineimkhieh mizawngte lahah i op hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuhilna a thupisim mite daupei ding a, Topa a muong mite mi nuomsa ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lungsim pilte pen thu theisiem kici a, kamsiem in mihuoi theina khangsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Pilnna pen a nei mite adingin hinna tuinah hi a, mottatna in mimawte kidantatna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mipilte’ lungsim in a kamham uh pilvang tahin hamsah a, amau’ nephu-ah mi zawl theina kibelapsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Kamsiem pen khuoibal tawh kibang a, hlagau adingin hlumin pumpi adingin cidamna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khatveivei man i sah lampi khat pen a tawpna-ah sina lampi na hizaw thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Nasemte in an a du ziehun na a sem vua, amau’ gilkielna in nasem dingin amate a sawlsawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Kimanna a nei lote in mi siet nading a ngaisun vua, a kamhamte uh ahile a katum thei meikuong bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A letat mite in kihauna a thezah vua, mi gensiete in lawmta ki-it lai a khenkham uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi tatsiete in a vengte zawlin, a hoilo lampi-ah a pui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />A mit-hem tawh mi hopite in sil hoi lo a gel vua, a nephu ei lesan pa in thusie tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Samkanna pen minthanna lukhu ahi hi; tua khu dihna hinkhuo tawh kinga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Thagum hatna sangin lungduoina hoizaw a, khuopi khat a zo pa sangin a lungsim a zo pa hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Puontuol tungah ai kisan nanleh Topa beh in khensatna pie hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kihauna tawh innsung dima pawi an nehna sangin lungnopna tawh an gumgaw halno khat nehna hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Pilvang tahin a gamta sila khat in zumhuoi tahin a gamta tapa uh a, innkuon sung mite khat bangin ama in gamh a tang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sia a kihuontuina-ah ngun kihalin, meikhuh sungah kham kisittel a, ahi vangin Topa in mihing lungtang sittel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sietna a bawl mite in kamham gilo a ngai vua, zuouthu gen mipa in thu ginalo kigente a thupisim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mizawngte a thusim lote in amau a Bawlpa simmaw ahi uhi; midangte’ tuosietna-ah a thangphate pen dan thuoh loin a om sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuute pen tehsiete’ mang lukhu ahi a, nu le pate pen tate’ angtanna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thuhoi genna pen mimawte adingin kilawm lo hi; zuouthu genna pen gam-uhte adingin kilawm lo kan lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Guhgol pen a piete’ muna-ah suong-ai tawh kibang a, a kihei napo vuah a daupei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi’ khielna a maisah pa in lawm le guol hau a, mi tawh a kisel den pa in lawm le guol a tan ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mimaw khat zavei i sat sangin thu khinkhai thei khat khatvei i phawsietna pen thuh bunzaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Migilote in ledona ding behbeh a sui vua, hinanle amate do dingin kamtai gilo khat kisawl ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mottat mimaw khat tawh i kisih sangin a tano kilah pieh vompi tawh kituo ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuhoi sietna tawh a thuhkia mipa’ inn sung panin sietna veng ngai lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kihauna kipatna pen tuikuong ke pana a luong tui tawh kibang hi, tua hi a, kihau masanga khawl pai khian ding ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migilote dih a tangsah pa le midihte maw a tangsah pa pen Topa dingin a ni-in kidahhuoi tuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sin nopna lungsim a nei lo mimawte’ khut sungah, pilna sin nadingin bang hangin sum ki-ap ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lawm le guolte in ei it den a, sanggamte ahile hahsat huna ei thuohpi dinga ang pieng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A vengpa ’ leiba a lopieh dingin kikhamin, kamciem piehna pen thu theimaw vai ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Gamtat khielna a dei pa kihauna dei ahi a, a sangkil a sang lamte pen gu tawn nading sui ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lungsim kawite nuomsa ngai lo a, zuouthu a gente in hamsietna tuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Tapa maw a neite in lunggimpi a, tapa maw a nei nu le pate lung nuom lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Lungtaina in zatui hoi khat ahi a, lungkiehna in gu le tangte gawtasah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thutang lampi heimang nadingin migilote in guhgol a daplah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Thu khinkhai thei pa in pilna en a, mimawte’ mit in leimong dong a en kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ta mawte a pate’ lunggimna ahi a, a hing nu adingin sinkhamna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Maw nei lo pa tungah lieu tuosah pen hoi lo a, a citahna uh ziehin mi thupite sat huoi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Thugen ki-ip mipa in pilna nei ahi hi; a sip khinkhian mipa zong theitelna nei ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A sip dide mimawte nangawn a pil dingin kingaisun hi; kamkeh loin a op ciengun, thu thei dingin kingaisun hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ama guoha a tolten pa pen a nop banga om pa ahi a, mantaha kikhensa thu a thusim lona lah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mimaw khat in theitelna lamah nuom a sa sih a, ama’ mimal ngaisutna beh a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Gitlona a tun ciengin simmawna zong tung a, mindaina a tun ciengin mindaina in zui pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kam tawh thukigente tui thuhpi tawh kibang hi; pilna tuinah ahile luitui pulkhie bang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mawneite deisahin tuomhuom hoi lo a, midihte thukhenna tut ding hoi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mimaw khat’ kamham in kihauna piengsah a, mimaw khat’ kamham in tepuong ding ngen ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mimawte’ kamham in amau’ kisietna hi a, amate adingin a nephute uh pen thang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Migensiete’ kamham pen antui tawh kibang a, tua khu pumpi sung lamah a tumsuh pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Nasep thada mipa pen sil susiepa tawh sanggamta ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Topa’ min pen a muonhuoi tausang ahi hi; tua sungah midihte tai-in hlamuong uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mihaute’ neilelam in a kip a khuopite uh ahi hi; a ngaisutna vuah tua pen a sang kulpi tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kisietna a tun masangin mi lungsim kiliensah a, patawina masangah kiniemkhiehna a pei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi khat in a zahcien masanga thu khat a dawn leh, tua pen a mothuoi le a zumhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Mihing’ lungsim in natna thuohzo napi, a kitamzan lungsim koi in thuoh zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thu ngaisun thei khat in theina khol a, mipilte’ bil in theina sui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Letsong in kotte hong a, tua in miliente tawh kimusah thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Midang khat pei-in a dawhcien masang sie-in thu gen masa pen pa-a’ a man tawh a kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Aisanna in kiselna vengsah a, mi thahat thu kitute kikalah thu khenpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sanggam kisietna pen khuopi khat lut sangin hamsa zaw a, tua banga kihauna pen khuopi tunkot golhte tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A kamhamna panin mi gilva a, a nephu-a a genna in a taisah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leii’ thuneina sungah sina le hinna om a, a leii a it mite in a ga a ne ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Zi mu zo pa pen sil hoi mu ahi a, Topa tung pana maipha nga ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mizawngte a ham ciengin thumna kam a zang vua, mihaute in khautahin a dawng uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lawm hoi kipang kimkhat om a, hinanle lawm hoi tahtah pen sanggamte sangin hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zuouthu gen mimaw pa sangin citahna tawh kalsuon mizawng pa hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Theina kici nei lopi-a lunggulna pen hoi lo a, a nawpei mi pa in lam a khiel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mi khat’ mottatna in sietna tun a, Topa tungah a lungthah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hauna in lawm le guol tampi neisah a, mizawngte, lawm le guol nei loin kinuasie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zuou teci pang pa dan thuoh loin om lo ding a, zuou gen mipa suohta lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi tampi in uliente’ maipha a sui vua, letsong pie pa pen mi zosie’ lawm ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mizawngte pen a tanaute nangawn in muda ahile, a lawm a guolte in bangza-in pel zaw kan lai ding ahei! Amate hlanin a del ciengin tua sungah amate a om nawn sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Pilna suipa ahile ama le ama ki-it ahi a, thutelna nei ding pen daupei nading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Zuou teci a pang pa dan thuoh loin om lo ding a, zuouthu gente zong kisie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mimawte a noptat ding uh kilawm lo a, sila khat in uliente a uh ding kilawm lozaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thu ngaisun siemte a lung uh duoi a, khielna khat kimumaw bawl pen vangneina ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kumpipa’ lungthahna pen humpinelkai’ hawh tawh kibang a, ahi vangin ama’ maipha ahile lopa tunga a kie daitui tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tapa maw pen a pa adingin kisietna hi a, mi tawh a kihauhat zi pen a theu thei lo guomal kie tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Inn le neisate pen nu le pa tung pana kiluo hi a, zi pil ahile Topa tung pan ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thasietna in kimut dusah a, a thada mipa a gilkiel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thupieh a zuite a hing ding uhi; a lampi uh a thusim lote si ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mizawngte tunga a thusiem poma Topa a leitawisah ahi a, a kiningcingin kisangsahkia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lamet a op hun sungin na tate thuhil in; amau’ kisiet nading lamah na lungsim koi sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A lungtom mi tatsie pa in mawna dan thuoh ding hi; va hunkhie ta lacin na hutkhiet kiakia kul ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mailam hun ciengin pilna na nga nadingin thukuppina ngai inlen, thuhilna mang in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Mihing lungsim in gelna tampi nei a, ahizongin Topa’ ngaisutna beh kip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi khat tungah a deihuoi thu in tahtaina hi a, zuougen mi khat hi ding sangin mizawng khat hi ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Topa zatahna in hinna tahtah ahi hi; tua tawh a kidim mipa nuomtahin khawlin, gimna a thuoh sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi thasiepa in a khut tawh ankuong sawhsuh a, a kam sunga a an tutkia ding nangawn a nuom sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi simmawte sat in; tua hile thuthei lo mipa in theina a nga ding hi. Thuthei mipa phawhsie in, tua hile amate in theina a nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A pate tungah tatsie-in a nu a delmangte pen maizumna a piengsah le mindaina a tut tate ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ka ta aw, thuhilna na zah thei nadingin thu theinate panin na piel ding khawl in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kimanna a nei lo teci in thutang pen ciemmuina-in nei a, migilote’ kam in khielna valtum hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Mi thusim lote adingin mawsahna a baisa-in om a, satna pen mimawte’ elzang ading ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zu in mi zawnkhaw vagiap-in, zucia in mi kihausah a, zu in a puisiet mi poma mipil ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A zauhuoi kumpipa’ lungthahna in a hawh vapom humpi tawh a kibang hi; ama a lungthahsah poma in a silaw vagiap uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kiselna lah pana a kihemdawh pa kipahta a, hizongle mimaw poma a kihau paipai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mi thasiepa in a hunin lo a hlo sih a, anlah hun ciengin a lah ding bangma a om pai sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mihingte’ lungtup pen tuili bangin thuh a, hinanle thutel siem mite in tuate a sawh sieng ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi tampite amau le amau mi citahin a kigen vua, ahi vangin a muontah mi koi in mu zo ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Midihte citahna tawh a kalsuon vua, amate nua a zui tate mi nuomsa ahi uhi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thukhenna topha tunga a to kumpipa in ama’ mit tawh sietna zosie pum zap bangin zap sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ka lungsim ka siengsah hi; ka mawna panin ka sieng hi,” koi in ci thei ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A gihna kibang lo le tena kibang lote a ni-in Topa adingin a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Naupangte nangawn in a silbawlte a siengtho le a man ahi lam amau’ sepkhietna tawh a kitheisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Khuo zahna bil le khuo muna mit, tuate gel a nipi-in Topa’ bawl ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kimut du vawt sin, tua hile na zawnlaw kha ding hi; na mit hahsah lenlon in, tua hile an le tui na nieng ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Van leipa in, “Hoi sih, hoi sih,” cici napi, a peizaw ciengin a kisahtheipi veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kham le suong manpha tampi om a, hinanle theina a nei pa’ thugente pen suong manpha ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Mi khat in gelta pa’ leiba lopieh nadinga a pieh a khapna puon la inlen, gamdang mite tungah pieh dinga a kamciemsa tua khapna van matpieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Solna tawh kinga an tui vangut a, hinanle tua zaw ciengin kam sungah suongtang a dim ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thukuppina ziehin gelnate kip hi; pilna tawh lamkaina zui-in gal kisim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Mi gensietna in thusim teng pholah hi; tua ahi ziehin a mot-ham mite tawh kigop sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Na nu le na pa na samsiet leh mielking lahah na meivah kisumit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A patna lama kinga dihauna pen a tawpna-ah thupha hi lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Sietna ka thuhkia ding hi,” ci sin; Topa ngah in, ama in ang hu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A gihna kikim lote Topa adingin kidahhuoi a, tawisuong man lote hoi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />I kalsuonna zosie uh Topa’ sesa ahi hi; tua ahi mawh leh i gamtatnate i bangci thei ding uh ahei”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi khat mot-ham pahin, “Tami a siengtho hi na,” ci-a a gen paina le kamciem a piehzaw cienga a nua ngaisut pan pen ama thang kisie ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A pil kumpi in migilote tengkhie a, a tung vuah lengkang tawh a huol hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mihing lungsim pen Topa’ meivah hi a, i sungtawng dongin a sui hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Kumpipa in citahna le muonhuoina kemcing a, dihtatna tawh a topha a tukip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Khangnote’ thupina pen a thahatna uh ahi a, khanghamte’ melhoina pen a samkanna uh ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Vuohna zieha liemna in gitlona sawp sieng a, kisatna in a sungtawng dongin siengsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kumpipa’ lungtang pen luitui luong tawh kibang a, Topa’ khut sungah a om hi; ama in ama’ deideina po-ah a hei kawikawi lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A sempa’ muna-ah sepna zosie man a, hizongle Topa in mite’ lungtang a tawikhai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Topa in biehpiehna sangin thuman le thutang sep ding deizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A kihisah mittang le a kiphasah lungtang- migilote’ meivah- khu mawna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nasep thanuomte’ gelna in kiningcinna ei tun valon a, hinanle a dihau nuom poma kitasam ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zuou genna tawh a kinga nei le lamte pen a lengmang tuikhu le sina thang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Migilote a manin a gamtat nuom lo ziehun, a tatsietna un amate kaiphit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mikhielte’ lampi kawilieng a, mi siengthote’ gamtatna a man hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi tawh a kihau hat zi tawh inn sung khat ah i tenton sangin innkhum zang kiu khatah ten ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Migilote’ lungsim in sietna dei a, amau’ muna-ah a vengte in hepina mu kha lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Misimmaw khat dan a kipieh ciengin thu thei lote in pil law a, mipilte thu a kihil ciengin a thu theina uh khang semsem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midih Pa in migilote’ inn kantel a, ama in a kisie dingin migilote a sawnpua hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mizawngte kikona na bil na hum leh nangma na kiko ding a, ang kidawng lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Letsong kidappieh in lungthahna daisah hi; kang sunga kipie phuolsel guhgol in sinsona damsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thutanga na a kisep ciengin midihte adingin kipahna ahi a, ahi vangin sietna a bawlte adingin lungkiehna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thutelna lampi pana vahmang mite pen misite kikhopna-ah a khawl ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A noptat nuom poma tasam ding a, zu le sathau hai poma hau lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Migilote pen midihte adingin kitatna hi a, upna a nei lote pen mi thumante adingin kitatna ma ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />A phunhat le a hangsan zi tawh tenton sangin senel gamgaw-ah teng hit hiet leih hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mipilte’ inn sungah gou manpha omsuoh a, mimawte in tuate a netum pai uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Dihtatna le migitna a del poma in hinna le patawina a mu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Galhangte tenna khuopi sim dingin mipil khat kuonto a, amau’ muon mama khuo kulpi a satguoipieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kam le leii kep siemna in buoina tawh ei kipelsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi kiphasah, mi kihisah pa pen “Misimmaw pa” kici a, ki-uongsahna tawh a gamta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mi thadate’ khut in na sem nuom lo ahi ziehin mi thada pa’ deigawna in sina a piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Migilote in sunthapai-in a deigaw mielmuol vua, midihte ahi uleh hen kici nei loin a pie uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Migilote’ biehpiehna kidah a huoi hi; ngimna hoi lo tawh a tawi ciengun kidahhuoi zaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zuouthu tecipang pa kisie ding a, thungai siem pa in guolzo tahin teci pang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Migilote in hansan mel a puo a, mi thumante in a pei nading ngaisun uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Topa langkhatah pilna, thutheina, kithumopnate kimanna nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Galsim ni-a zah dingin sakol a baisa-in kikoi a, hizongle galzawna pen Topa hang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Haunate sangin minphatna teelhuoi zaw a, ngun le kham sangin mi ei thupimuna hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A zawng le a hau in tami nei tuoh uhi: Amahaw zosie a bawlpa, Topa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mipilte in zauhuoina mu-in kiphuol pai hi; mimawte peisuohin gimna a thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Neilutna le Topa zatahna thaman in hauna, patawina le hinna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Migilote’ lampi-ah thang le so kisie hi; a kikem siemte in gamlapi panin tuate a pel uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lampi manah naupangte cil in, tua hile a vuoi dongun lampiel nawn lo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mihaute in mizawngte uh a, sum leitawi pa pen leitawi a pie pa’ sila a suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thudih lo a vaw poma in hamsietna a at ding vua, ama lungthahna ciengpum a kisusie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A phal mite in thupha nga ding hi, azieh pen amate in mizawngte an a hawm uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Misimmaw pa notmang dawh in, tua hile kiselna dai pai ding hi; kihauna le kisimmawnate zong a veng pai ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lungsim siengtho a dei mipa le kamsiema thugen mipa in kumpipa lawmin a nei ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Topa’ mit in theina neite vil a, upna nei lote’ thugente a thalpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi thadapa in, “A pulamah humpi khat om! lampi-ah ei kithat kha va!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A thangtat numei khat’ kam pen dum thuhpi khat ahi hi; tua dum sungah Topa' lungthahna a tuhna mipa a kiesuh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Naupangte pen a mot gamtat ngaina hi a, ahi vangin thuhilna ciengpum in gamlapi-ah a notmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A hau nuom ziehin mizawngte bawlsie-in, mihaute a piete in supna beh nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mipilte’ thugente: Na bil ei ngatin ka thugente za inlen, na lungsim sungah kang thuhilte lutsah in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />azieh pen tua thute na lungsim sungah vomin, tuate zosie a gen sieng dingin kithawi lacin nuom na sa ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Topa na muon thei nadingin tuni-in na kungah tua thute kang theisah zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Nang adingin kithuhilna le pilna thu nam sawm thum hing gielpiehin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />a mantaha na dawnkia thei nadingin ang sawlpa tungah hing genpieh hi lo ka mah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A zawn ziehin mizawngte neisa lahpieh sinlen, mi gentheite tunkotah nuoithop sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />azieh pen amau’ vai-ah Topa pang a, amate a bulute’ hinna a bulu ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A thangpai bai mite tawh kilawmta sinlen, a lungtom mite tawh zong kigop sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tua hile amau’ gamtatnate zui-in thangah noma zong na awh ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Midangte’ leiba a lopieh dingin kikhamin kamciem a motpieh mite lahah kihal kha sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Leiba lo nading bangma na nei sih leh, bang zieha nangma’ nei-a lupna hing kilahpieh ding ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Na pu na pate’ na phusa kigi suong khin sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A nasepna vuah a siem mi na mu ei mah? Amate in kumpite’ na a sem ding vua, mi nautangte’ na a sem sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Gam-uhte tawh an ne dinga na toton ciengin na mai-ah bang om ci hoitahin en inlen,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />anhai mi na hi leh na lawl-ah namta khat koi in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kisolna an ahi ziehin gam-uhpa’ antuite dugaw sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Hau nop manin gimpipi-in nasem sin; pilvangin khawl hun thei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Na mit mu sungin tuate tawpmang thei lel hi; azieh pen tua in thakhatin muvanlai bangin, a hla zapin vantung lamah a lengto ta hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mi cilpawngte’ an nehpieh sin; a an tuite uzong dugawpieh sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />azieh pen tuate khu na dangtawng ang sun samzamte tawh kibang ahi hi. Amate in na kungah, “An ne inlen tui dawn in!” ang ci vangun, a lungsim tahpi uh hi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Halkhat na neh sunsun na luokia ding a, na kamsiem gen teng maimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mimaw pa’ zahna-ah thugen sin, na pil thugen teng ang simmawpieh lel ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tanglai kigi suongte khin sinlen, pa nei lote’ logam kehpieh sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Azieh pen amau’ tanpa thahat a, na langkhat vuah amate panpi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kithuhilna-ah na lungsim ngat inlen, theina thu lamah na bil daw in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na tate thuhil ding kidiem sin; ciengduoi tawh sat nan lacin si lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Amate ciengduoi tawh sat lacin, Misikhuo panin a hinna uh na hunkhie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ka ta aw, na lungsim a pil leh ka lungdam mama ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Na kam in thuman a gen ciengin ka hlagau a kipah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na lungtang in mawneite engsah sinlen, Topa zatahna zom peisuoh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mai lam hun khat pel lo-in om tahpi a, na kinepna a mawhna-in maimang lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka ta aw, ka thugen za-in pil inlen, tua lampi-ah na lungsim hei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Zuhaite lahah om sinlen, sahaite lahah zong om sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Azieh pen zukhamte le anhaite zawng ding a, a kimutdu ziehun puonsie beh sil ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Na pienna na pa thu’ ngai inlen, na nu a vuoi ciengin simmaw sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Thuman thutah lei inlen zua sin; pilna, kithuhilna, le thu theitelna lei in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Midihte’ pa a lungdam mama ding hi; tapa pil a nei pa zong a tapa tungah lungdam ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Na nu le na pa lungdamsah in; na pienna na nu kipahsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka ta aw, na lungtang ei pie inlen, ka lampite mitsuon gige in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Numei pahtat khat pen dum thuh tawh kibang hi; angkawm numei khat pen a kuocih tuikhuh tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama in misuom pa bangin buhdap a, upna a nei lo mi pungsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Koi in gimna thuoh ahei? Koi in dan thuoh ahei? Koi kisel ahei? Koi phunphun ahei? A thu om lopi-in koi liem ahei? Koi a mit san giagua ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Zu ne-a a tokhote, zucia a ciem nuomte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />Hai sunga a phuon lihleh, lawl sunga a tumsuh vahiau, a san pimpem lengga zu etin zong nei vet sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua in a tawpna-ah gul bangin mi tu a, gul gunei in mi a tuh bang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Na mit in na lamdangte na mu ding a, na lungsim in letatna thu vive a gen ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuipi laizanga a lum mi tawh na kibang ding a, tembaw khuom dawna a lum mi tawh na kibang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />“Ei vuoh vangun ka liem sih hi; ei sat vangun ka phawh kha sih hi. Bang hun ciengin ka khanglo diei? ka dawn ding zu suikia vang,” na ci ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Migilote eng sinlen, amate tawh kigop ding lunggul sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />azieh pen a lungsim un tatsiet ding ngaisun a, a kam un mi buoisah ding beh genin nei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilna tawh inn kilam a, theitelna tawh tua inn kip hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />lunggel siemna tawh innkhan sung teng na manpha le na hoi zosiete tawh kidim hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi thahatte sangin mipil galhangte hatzaw a, thagum hatte sangin thu theina a neite hatzaw hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />azieh pen makai siemna tawh gal kizo a, thukuppi a tamna-ah guolzawna om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Mimawte adingin pilna pen sang luo hi; amate in tunkot-ah kam a keh sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sietna bawl ding a sawm poma buoina bawlpa kici ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thu mot ngaisutna pen mawna hi a, mi simmawte pen mi zosie dinga a kidahhuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hamsat hun ciengin na lungkieh leh a thazawngkhal na hi hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />sina lam zuona kipeipi mite le gaw dinga kikai mite hunkhie in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />note in, “En in, tami theikha sih vung,” na ci uleh, lungsim a tawikhai pa in thei lo ding amah? Na hlagau a kemcing pa in zong thei lo ding amah? Amau’ gamtatna tawh kituohin ama in mi zosie thuhkia lo ding amah?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ta aw, khuoizu a tui ziehin ne inlen, khuoibal pana a luongte na kamah hlum mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Pilna zong na hlagau adingin tua bang ahi lam thei in; pilna na mu leh, na mailam na mu ding a, na kinepna a kikhahtan sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Migilote bangin thuman mite’ inn buhdap sinlen, thuman mite’ tenna munah va tatsie ta sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile amate sagivei a pua vangun a thokia ding uhi; ahi vangin migilote ahile tuosietna in a thalpai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na galte a pua ciengin lungdam sinlen, a kipalkhah ciengin zong thangpha sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tua bang na bawl le Topa in mu-in a lungkim sih ding a, amate kung panin a lungthahna heimang ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sietna bawlte ziehin lunghimaw sin. Migilote eng vawt sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />azieh pen migilote in mailam a nei sih uhi; migilote’ meivah a mit ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka ta aw, Topa le kumpipa zatah inlen, tua tegel’ thu mang loin om sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />azieh pen ama gel kung panin tuosietna thakhatin ang pei a, tua tegel’ tunsah thei ding sietna koi in thei ahei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tamte zong mipilte’ thugente ahi hi: Thukhenna-ah deidan nei hoi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Migilote kungah, “Mawna nei sih teh,” a ci poma mipite in samsie-in minamte in muda ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />hinanle migilote a samsiete a lung uh kim ding a, amate tungah thupha hoi tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A mana a dawng mipa pen a nephu tawh mi tawp ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />A pulam nasep ding bawlkhol inlen, na lo-a nasep ding a baisa-in koi in; tua zaw ciengin na inn lam in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Thu om lopi-in na innvengpa langkhatah teci pang sinlen, na kam panin zuouthu gen sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Amate in kei tunga ang bawl bangin midangte tungah ka bawl ding hi; amau’ ei bawl bangin ken zong amate ka thuhkia ding hi,” ci sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Mi thasiepa’ lo lai ka nawhkha a, mimaw pa’ lengga lo ka zawtkha hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />ka et ciengin mun zosie-ah lingkung po hi; lahkhai in a leitang khumang a, daithaw suong teng cimguoi sieng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Tua bang teng ka mu ciengin ka lungsan hi; tua pen ka en a, thuhilna khat ka nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bakhat sung kimutna, haituh pahna le a khawl dingin bakhat sung khupzepin na op kalin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />nang tungah misuom pa bangin zawnna le galhiem a tawi galhangpa bangin tasapna ang tung ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tam teng pen Judah Kumpipa Hezekiah’ uliente in a teikhiet Solomon’ paunahte ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu ipna pen Pasien’ minthanna hi a, thu kankhiet pen kumpite’ minthanna ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vantungte sangin leitung a thuh zaw ma bangin kumpite’ lungsim zong thuhin kikan zo lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ngun panin a eh la dawh leih ngunkheng pa adingin vanzah khat suoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kumpipa’ mai panin migilote la dawh leih dihna sungah a kumpi topha kip ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kumpipa mai-ah kithupisah sinlen, miliente’ dinna munah ding kha sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />azieh pen mithupi khat’ mai-a ei kiniemkoi sangin, “Tanah hing to ta’n,” ei kici ding hoizaw hi. Na mit in a mu popo
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />thukhen zum tut paipai sin; azieh pen na vengte in hing maizumsah leh a tawpna-ah nang in bang na law ta diei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na vengpa beh ma tawh thu kisel inlen, midangte’ thusim pholah sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />tua hile ang zuidap khat in ang maizumsah ding a, na minsietna a tawp ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A kilawm hunin kamteng khat genkhiet pen ngunpeh tunga kham apple kisuong tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A sang thei mipa adingin pilna tawh mi phawsietna pen kham bilba ahi sihle kham kizepna tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kamtai muonhuoite pen a sawlte adingin anlah hun cienga vuakhal vot tawh kibang a, tuate in a pute’ lungsim thasuosah hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />letsong a pieh ngai lopi a kisielpipa pen guo a zusah lo meiite le huipite tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Lungduoina tawh gam-uhpa kithuzaw thei a, kam nem in guletangte hliehtawng zo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuoizu na mu leh na khamkhop za beh ne in, tua hi sihle na tam neh sengin na luo kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na vengpa’ inn ah haw mun seng sin, na haw mun leh na vengpa in hing cimtahin hing muda ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />A vengpa’ langkhatah a man lo teci a pang pa pen phawhbul, namsau, ahi sihle thal hiemte tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Hahsat hunin a zuoutat mi khat i muon khah pen hana khat, ahi sihle khelbai khat tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi lunggim khat kunga lasa pa pen liemma tunga lengga tuithua sunsuh tawh kibang hi. Puonsil lahah a om nget bang ahi sihle sing lahah a om lungpuh tawh kibang a, dana in mihingte’ lungtang hlaiguoi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Na galte a gilkiel leh a neh ding an pie inlen, a dangta uleh a dawn ding tui pie in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />azieh pen tua bang bawl lacin amau’ lu tungah meikamsa a sungsuh na hi ta ding a, Topa in thaman ang pie ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Leilu lam hui in guo zusah a, mi sutuo thei leii in lungthah mel puo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Mi tawh kihau hat zi tawh inn khat sunga tenton sangin innkhum vum kiu khata ten hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuol gamlapi pana thuhoi zahna pen a dangta mi khat in tuivot tui a sah tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi thumante in migilote a zuikhah pen tuinah buon le tuikhuh nieh tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Khuoizu tam neh seng ding hoi lo a, mi ei patawi ding hasui zong hoi lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Ama le ama a ki-uh zo lo mipa pen kulpi nei lo, a kulpi a cimzan khuopi tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khal lai-a vuakie le anlah huna guozuh bangin mimawte adingin patawina kilawm lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A thu om lopi-a samsietna pen tupna a nei lo gitta hon leng bang le a leng kawikawi sielpaleng tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sakol sat nadingin khaupum kisamin, laa adingin kamkaih kisam a, mimawte elduong sat nadingin ciengduoi kisam hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Mimawte a motna tawh kizui-in dawng sin, na dawn leh nang zong a maw na hi ta ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mimawte a motna tawh kizui-in dawng in, tua hi sihle amau’ mit-ah a pil kisa thei ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Mimaw khat kamtai-a sawlna pen ama’ keng a sattan, tatsietna tui dawn pa tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khelbai pa’ keng a kimawh khai bangin mimawte’ kama paunah kigen pen kimanna nei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mimawte patawi pen saili kuong sunga sailungtang khicip tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mimaw khat’ kam pana paunah thuhilna pen zukham pa’ khuta a gieh den ling tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mimaw a tuokhah khatpo, ahi sihle zukham khatpo tha a ciel pa pen mi zosie a ban liemsah thalkap pa tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ui in a luoh a nehkia bangin mimaw pa zong a mottat kia zel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A muna vuah pil a kisa mi na mu ei mah? Amate sangin mimawte adingin lametna omzaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi thasiepa in, “Lampi-ah humpi om! Gawldung teng ah humpi om!” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A kikhaina kawmpeh tungah kotpi a kihei bangin, mi thasiepa a lupna tungah kihei kawikawi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi thasiepa in ama’ khut tawh ankuong sawhsuhin, a kam sunga a tutkia ding pen gim a kisa mama hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A kilawm a kituoha thu a dawng thei mi sagi sangin mimaw khat ama’ kimuna-ah pil kisazaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Midangte’ kihauna-ah a kikumthaw pa pen ui vahmuong khat a bila a kai kawikawi mi pawlkhat tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Si theina singkhuo-am le thaltang mot kap mimawpa le
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />a vengpa solin, “Ka ciemmuina hi bo!” a ci pa a kibang giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Singkhuo a op sih leh mei mit a, mi gensietna a op lona munah kihauna veng hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Meihol in mei amsahin singkhuo in mei a kuonsah bangin mi tawh, kihauhat pa in kiselna kuontaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Gensietna kamteng pen antui mama tawh kibang a, mihing’ pumpi sungtawngah tuate a tumsuh pai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Lungsim gilo napi a kamzol dihdehte pen cim kizut leibeel tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Galte in lungsim tah gen loin amau’ sungah mi sol nopna beh a om hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />a lungsim sungah a huothuoi thu sagi tah kiphuol ahi ziehin, galpa khat in kam nem tawh ang hopi ciengin um malmal sin;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />a ngianku tawh mudana phuol nanle mi hon lahah galpa’ gitlona kipholah veve ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Dum to poma tua sung ma-ah kiesuh ding a, suongtum lia poma ama tung ma-ah tua suongtum a tukia ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Zuouthu genna leii in a solsa mite muda a, mipawhna kam in sietna piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zing cieng hun adingin kimasiel sin, azieh pen ni khat in bang hing piengsah ding ci na thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nangma’ kam tawh kiphattawm sinlen, midang in kiphatsah zaw in. Nangma’ kam tawh hi loin thei lo mi khat in hing genphazaw heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Suongtum gih a, senel zong gih hi, hizongle tua tegel sangin mimawte’ lungthahna gihzaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thangpaina pen siehuoi a, lungthahna in mi valtum thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Phuolsel itna sangin langtang phawsietna hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />I guolte’ ei liemsahna pen ei deisahna uh ahi a, galte khat’ ei biengtawp pen ei lebawlna ahi bo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A gilva seng mipa in khuoizu du nawn lo a, a gilkiel mipa in a kha nangawn hlumsa hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Inn pana a vahmang mipa pen a bu sung pana a lengmang va tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sathau namtui le panamtui in lungsim nuomsah a, lungkham buoinate in mihing' lungsim kehkhesah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nangma’ lawm le na pa’ lawm le guolte taisan sin; na tuosiet ni ciengin na sanggamte’ inn ah haw sin. A gamla-a om sanggamte sangin a nai-a om innveng khat hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ta aw, pil inlen ei simmaw poma ka dawn thei nadingin ei lung nuomsah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Mipilte in a zauhuoina mu-in a kiphuol pai uhi; mimawte ahile a peisuoh vua, gimna a thuoh uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi khat in gelta pa’ leiba lopieh nadinga a pieh a khapna puon la inlen, gamdang mite tungah pieh dinga a kamciemsa tua khapna van matpieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Koipo in zingmawng thobai-in awging tawh a innvengpa thupha a pieh pen samsietna-in kingaisun ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mi tawh a kihau hat zi pen tualai-a a theu thei lo guociin tawh kibang hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />tua nu kham ding pen hui i kham tawh kibang a, ahi sihle zietlam khuta sathau i ham tawh kibang ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sia in sia ma tat hiem thei a, mi khat in midang khat pilsah thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Theikung a cingte in a ga ne ding a, a pupa kem poma kipatawi ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tui in maitang a lensawn bangin mihing khat’ lungsim in midang khat a lengsawnkia hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Misikhuo le Sietna lungkim ngai lo a, mihing’ mittang zong lungkim ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Sia kihuontuina-ah ngun zong kihalin, meikhuh sungah kham kize-et a, phatna tawh mihing khat kisittel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mimaw khat pen antang tawh sum sungah suh tawh gawitha nan lacin, a motna theu tuon lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Na tuuhonte’ opdan thei siem inlen, na bawnghonte limtahin kem in;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />azieh pen hauna a kip zing sih a, kumpi lukhu zong khang tawntungin kip lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Lopate a ki-at ciengin a tha ang suongkia a, muoltunga lohingte ki-atin a kikhol ciengin,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />tuute in na puon ding hing sihin, na keelte in lo cing khat’ man ang pie ding hi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />nangma’ neh ding, na innkuonpite neh ding le na nasem numeite na vah nadingin, keel nawite a kicingin ang om ding hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Koima’ del lopi-in migilote taimang a, midihte ahile humpi bangin hangsan uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Gam sung mite a tawnkhiel ciengin, gam-uh ding mi tampi a nei uhi; ahi vangin mipil gam-uh khat’ vang tawh vaihawmna kip den hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Mizawngte a bawlsie gam-uh pa khat pen ankungte hen nei loin a satpai guo tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thukham a taisan mite in migilote a pahta vua, thukham zui mite ahile amate tawh kilem lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Mi tatsiete in thutang a thei sih vua, Topa a suite in tua thu a cingin a thei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A lungsim kawi mihau khat i hi ding sangin a citah mizawng khat i hi ding hoizaw hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Thukham zui mite pen ta pil ahi vua, a gongsan mite tawh kigopte in nu le pa a maizumsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />A neisa belap nadinga a met tampi a la pa pen mizawng a khuotuo midang khat dinga sum kholpieh hi lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mi khat in thukham a zui nuom lo ciengin ama’ thungetnate nangawn a huothuoi ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi thuman khat pen sietna lampi-a puikhielte amau’ tawsa dum sungah kie ding a, genbanglo mite in ahile gamh hoi a luo ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amau’ kimuna-ah mihaute pil kisa mama a, a zawng mipil pa in a opdan panun thei pai lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Midihte a vangliet ciengin lungdamna lienpi om a, migilote a guolzaw ciengin mite kiphuolmang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A khielna imcipte koima daupei lo ding a, mawna pulahin tuate a nuasie mipa in hepina nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A zau ngai lo mipa pen mi nuomsa ahi a, a lungtang khaute in tuosietna thuoh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mizawngte a uh migilopa pen humpi hawh vapuoh le mi a del vapual vompi tawh kibang hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thu teltheina a nei lo gam uhpa pen a gilo mi bawlsie pa ahi hi; a man lo-a ngana a muda pa a khankum sawt ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Mi khat in midang khat thatin sisan a suo leh, tua mithatpa pen a si dongin khuotai hi taheh; koima in ama huna pie sih heh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Citahna tawh a kalsuonte kihun ding a, lampi kawi a zui poma Guom sungah kiesuh ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Lo a hlo tapo neh le tah nieng ding a, kimanna nei loin a taapva pa a zawng puong ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mi muonhuoite in thupha tampi nga ding a, a haubai nuom mipa pen dan thuoh loin om lo ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Huptuom le paituom neina pen hoi lo hi, hinanle neh ding an halkhat ziehin mi khiel thei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Mi huoiham le mi cilpawngte in amate kunga a tung ding supna thei lopi-in a nawhau nuom uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Kam tawh miphatpa sangin mi phawhsie pa in a nua ciengin maipha ngazaw ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />A nu a pa’ neisa teng lahpiehin, “Tami khielna hi sih,” a ci mipa pen mi siesahpa tawh kipawl ma hi veve hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />A huoiham mi in kihauna kuontaw a, Topa a muong mite a hau ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />A pilna a suongte mimaw ahi uhi; pilna tawh kalsuonte in lungmuonna nga ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Mizawngte tungah sil a pie poma in bangma kisapna nei lo ding a, mizawngte a kimumaw-bawl poma in samsietna tampi nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Migilote a guolzaw ciengin mite kiphuolmang hi; amate ang kisiet ciengin midihte a pung hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="29" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kiphawhphawh nanle a lungkhau paupaute damsah zawh lo za dongin kisie ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Midihte a vaihawm ciengin mipite lungdam hi; migilote a vaihawm ciengin mipite genthei-in tau uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilna a dei tapa in a nu le a pa lungdamsah a, numei pahtatte tawh a kigop mipa in a neisa teng mawhmai sah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kumpipa in thutang tawh a gam kipsah a, sum don hat kumpipa in a gam susie hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A vengpa a maitang phat poma a vengpa, ama' kengah a awh thei nadinga a thangsiena ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A tatkhielna ziehun migilote thangah awh a, midihte in ahile lungdamin la sa uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Midihte in mizawngte’ nga ding lawm teng a thei uhi; migilote in tua bang theitelna a nei sih uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Mi simmawte in khuopi khat a haltum vua, mipilte in thangpaina a daisah uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Mipil khat le mimaw khat zumah a kiheh leh kihosietna le kiselphona veng thei lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sisan a suo mite in genbanglo mite muda a, amate in midihte tha dingin a sui uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Mimaw pa in a lungthahna pulah sieng a, mipil pa dai tahin ki-ip hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Gam-uh pa khat in zuouthu po a tahsan leh, ama’ uliente zosie zong a gilo pai ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mizawng pa le mi bawlsie pa a kibahna tami ahi hi: Topa in a ni gelin a mit uh a vahsah tuoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Kumpipa in mizawngte tungah mantahin thu a khen leh, ama’ kumpi topha kip tawntung ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Ciengduoi le kiphaw kisapna in pilna ei pie a, bangma awlmaw lo naupang in a nu maizumsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Migilote in thu a nei ciengin tawnkhielna khang semsem a, midihte in amau’ pua dan a en ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Na tate thuhilin sam in, tua hile amate in toidamna ang pie ding hi; amate in na lung zong ang nuomsah ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Mukholna a op lona munah mipite thangtat a, thukham a zuite pen mi nuomsa ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Nasemte, kam maimai tawh kibawlpha thei lo hi, azieh pen amate in thu tel nan ule a thupisim sih ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />A phengham mi na mu ngai ei mah? Tua pa sangin mimaw khat ading lametna omzaw lai hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A neu lai pana a kihawmthaw bawl sila pa in a tawpna lamah sietna a tut ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A lungthah mi khat in kihauna piengsah a, mi lungtom khat in khielna tampi piengsah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Mi khat’ kihisahna in ama niemkhieh ding a, lungsim kiniemkhieh mi in patawina nga ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Guta tawh kigop pa pen a hinna muda ahi a, ama in mite’ samsietna a zah vangin bangma gen lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Midangte giinna in thang a kam a, Topa a muong mipa a lungmuong hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Mi tampite in gam-uhpa’ maipha sui a, hinanle Topa kung panin mi khat in thutang nga hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Midihlote in midihte huo a, migilote in zong mi thumante a huo uhi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="30" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jakeh’ thusuo kammalte ahi hi. Mipa in tam bangin gen hi: Pasien aw, kei ka gim a, Pasien aw, ka gim hi. Bangci zaw thei ding ka hei?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mihing buong dingin ka nah mot mama hi; mihing thutel theina ka nei vawt sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pilna ka na sin kha sih a, siengtho pa thu zong ka na thei sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Vantungah koi ka to-in kumsuhkia ahei? A khutkuoh sunga hui a hum thei koi ahei? A puonkulah tuipi a tun thei koi ahei? Leitung mong zosie a phutkip koi ahei? Tua pa’ min bang ahei? Tua pa’ tapa a min bang ahei? Nang na thei valon hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Pasien’ thugen zosie in a manna lahtel hi; ama a belte adingin kidalna lum ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ama’ kammalte belap sin, na belap leh ama in ang phawhsie ding a, mizuou na hi lam ang kimu ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangma kungah thu ni kang ngen hi; ka si masangin tua tegel ei niel sin:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zuou genna le mi solna panin a gamlapi-ah ei hemkhie in; ei hausah seng sinlen, lah ei zawngsah seng sin; ka kisap za lien an tawh ei vah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hau seng leng nangma kang niel ding a, “ Topa kici koi ahei? kang ci kha ding hi; zawng seng leng lah mi’ na guhpiehin ka Pasien’ min kang daisah kha ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A pupa kungah nasem khat mindaisah sin, na gensiet leh a nasempa in nang hing samsie-in ang kimawsah ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pate samsie-in a nute thupha a pie lo mi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Amate siengtho loin bua mama napi amau’ muna-ah sieng a kisa mi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />A kithupisah sengin van lamah sangda to-in a mitkhu mul a tozut mi a om hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A ha uh namsau tawh a kibang, gam sunga mizawngte a netum ding le, mihingte lahah micimawte a valtum dingin, a ha uh namta tawh a kibang mi a om hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vot in tanu ni nei a; “Ei pie in, ei pie in, ci-in a kiko uhi. A lungkim thei lo sil thum om hi; sil lite in, “Pha ta” a ci ngai sih uhi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Misikhuo, a ciing naubu, a dangta zing leitang, le “Pha ta” a ci ngai lo meikuong ahi uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />A pa simmaw bawlin a mitte phen a, a nu thu mang loin a motbawl mipa pen kuom sunga va-ahte in a mittang kheipieh ding a, langtate in a sa a ne ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lamdang ka sah mama sil thum a om hi; ka thei lo sil li a om hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vanlai zawlah muvanlai lenna lampi, suong tunga gul peina lampi, tuipi vumte tunga tembaw peina lampi, le nungah tangvalte peina lampite ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Angkawmnu’ gamtat zie tami ahi hi: Tua nu in angkawmin kisil sieng a, ama in, “Khielna bangma ka bawl sih hi,” ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Leitung kilingsah sil thum om a, tua in a thuoh zo lo sil li om hi. Tuate in:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Sila khat kumpi a suo cieng, mimaw khat in an a kham cieng;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />koima’ dei lo numei khat in pasal a nei cieng, nasem numei khat in a pinu’ za a suon cieng, ci teng ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Leitungah neu mama napi a pil mama sil li a om hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Mesite a tha uh hat lo napi khal sungin a neh ding an a khol uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ngalvangte zong hat lo napi suongkawmah a kuo ding bawl uhi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />kauphete in kumpi nei lo napi a honhonin a unpi-un a pei valiei uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Innlawite khut tawh kiman zo lel napi kumpite’ inn sungah a kimu thei giap hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />A kalsuondan uh a pikuon thum om a, a kalsuondan uh a thupi suo li a om hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Gamsate lahah a thahat pen, koima’ mai-ah a nuakin lo humpi;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A kihisah pei aahlui, le keeltang, a mite’ mai-ah a uongpie kumpipa ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" />Na mot ziehin nang le nang kitawisangin, ahi sihle thusie bawl ding na sawm ngai leh, na khut tawh na kam hum in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" />Bangzieh ahei cile bawngnawi lawhlawh leih bawngnawi khal hing suoh a, i nahkuo nah nuoi leih a si a suo ma bangin, i lungthah ciengin kihauna a pieng hi.
  </para>
  <chapter number="31" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />A nu in Kumpi Lemuel tunga a thugente ahi hi:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Hi lo hi, ka tapa aw! Hi lo hi, ka sunga pieng ka tapa aw! Hi lo hi, ka kiciemna ka tapa aw!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Numeite tungah na thatang teng zang sinlen, na lampi-ah kumpite a susie mite lutsah sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lemuel aw, kumpite pen zu dawn ding ahi sih a, gam-uhte zong zucia-te dugaw ding ahi sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tua hi mawh leh zu dawnin a thu khensate uh a mangngil ta ding vua, migentheite mite nga dinga kilawmte a leheipieh ta ding uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />A mangthai ding mipa zucia pie inlen, a lungkham mama mite zu pie in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Amate zu dawnsahin a zawn lam mangngilsah in, a lungkhamna uh phawhsah nawn sin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Thu a gen thei lote tangin genpieh inlen, micimawte’ hamphat nadingin genpieh in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Amate ading thu genin mantahin thukhen inlen, a zawng micimawte hamphatna ngasah in.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Koi in zi hoi mu zo ding ahei? Suongmanpha sangin manhamzaw tham hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A pasal in ama muong mama a, ama’ vangin a pasal a tasam ngai sih ding hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Ama in khan tawntungin a pasal tungah sil hoi bawl a, a siet nading bawl lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ama in samul le khau sui a, thanuom tahin a khut tawh na sem hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ama in sumbawlte’ tembaw bangin gamlapi panin a an ding a tut hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Khuomiel lahpi-ah tho-in a innkuonpite neh ding an a bawlpieh a, a nasem numeite’ sep dingte a vaihawmpieh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ama in logam khat lei sawmin a lei pai hi; ama in a thalawsa sum tawh lengga lo khat a bawl hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ama in nasep hakatin a nih singten a, a ban tegel a khausah hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Ama in a sumbawlna a met lam thei a, zankim zankhangin a meivah mit ngai lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ama in a khut tawh muizom a, a khut tawh siem gan hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mizawngte tungah a khut zah a, a khut tawh tasam mite a zam phei hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />A innkuonpi zosie puonlum a guon zo ziehin vua a kieh vangin a innkuonpite dingin lunghimaw lo hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Ama in a lupna tuom dingte bawl a, a puon pen saihadiel puon le puon ausante ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khuopi tunkota om upa vaihawmte lahah a pasal a to ciengin mite in ama a theikim uhi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ama in saihadiel puon khui-in tuate a zua hi; ama in kawnggate bawlin sumbawlte a puoh hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Ama’ kivonna puon pen hatna le zatahhuoina ahi a, ama in ang tung ding hunte a nuisan zieu lel hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ama in pilna tawh a kam kah a, ama in a leii panin khuotuo thuhilna dan a gen hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Ama in a innsung vaite hoitahin van a, thadana an a ne sih hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />A tate tho-in ama pen mi nuomsa nu a ci vua, a pasal in zong ama nu a pahta mama a:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Numei tampite in hoitahin semzo tama leh, nang in amahaw zosie na leh zo hi,” a ci hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Ngaibanna pen kisolna hi lel a, meihoina zong a mawhnapi hi lel hi. Hinanle Topa a zatah numei pen a phattah ahi hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />A khut tawh a sepna ga’ satanh pie unlen, mite in a nasepnate ziehin khuopi tunkotah phat ta uheh.
  </para>
</usx>
